---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    StateChange[State change transaction]
    Pending[Outbox pending]
    Dedupe{Dedupe key exists?}
    Ready{Pending and available now?}
    Claim[FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED over pending index]
    Leased[Pending with claim_token and future available_at]
    Topology[Declare durable exchange queues and bindings]
    Publish[Persistent mandatory publish with message id]
    Confirm{Broker confirms and routed?}
    Fence{Claim token still current?}
    Published[Outbox published]
    Retry[Pending with retry delay]
    Stale[Stale publisher result ignored]
    Failed[Outbox failed]
    Noop[No transition]
    Queue[Message broker]

    StateChange --> Dedupe
    Dedupe -- No --> Pending
    Dedupe -- Yes --> Noop

    Pending --> Ready
    Retry --> Ready

    Ready -- Yes --> Claim --> Leased --> Topology --> Publish --> Queue --> Confirm
    Ready -- No --> Noop

    Confirm -- Yes --> Fence
    Confirm -- No --> Retry
    Fence -- Yes --> Published
    Fence -- No --> Stale
    Retry --> Pending

    Pending -. Direct administrative update .-> Failed

    class StateChange command
    class Pending,Dedupe,Ready,Claim,Leased,Topology,Publish,Confirm,Fence,Retry,Stale system
    class Published success
    class Failed error
    class Noop component
    class Queue external
